              <h3><a href="#">Ethics Column</a></h3>
              <p>The goals for the Ethics column are to raise awareness of ethical issues for nurses across settings, specialties, and nationalities; inform readers about critical issues in ethics; encourage ethical thoughtfulness about ethical dilemmas that nurses face; and initiate commentary and responses from a variety of nurses globally.</p>
              <div class="ojin-columns__editor"><span>Editor:</span> Jeanne Merkle Sorrell, PhD, RN, FAAN and Christine Sorrell Dinkins, PhD</div>
